# XonAudio Studio — Environment Configuration
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values.

# Hugging Face Token (required for Stable Audio Open 1.0)
# 1. Create a free account at https://huggingface.co
# 2. Accept the license at https://huggingface.co/stabilityai/stable-audio-open-1.0
# 3. Generate a token at https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens
# 4. Paste it below (remove the # at the start of the line)
#HF_TOKEN=hf_your_token_here
